OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer latest report - on the UK's adult
OL,8,Fsocial care sector - says care homes
OL,9,Fappeared to be "something of an
OL,10,Fafterthought", and when patients were
OL,11,Fmoved there from hospitals there was
OL,12,Finitially no recommendation to isolate
OL,13,Farrivals
OL,15,FCare workers had to resort to desperate
OL,16,Fmeasures to get PPE, with some using
OL,17,Ffestival waterproof ponchos, painters'
OL,18,Foveralls and bin bags
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
