OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says outage affecting
OL,4,Abanks and court video links caused by
OL,5,A'power event'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of Revolut customers have
OL,8,Fexperienced problems, while Halifax
OL,9,Fsays it's "aware some customers are
OL,10,Fhaving issues"
OL,12,FElsewhere, the courts service says its
OL,13,Fvideo links are affected - the Criminal
OL,14,FBar Association says prosecution and
OL,15,Fdefence barristers in England and Wales
OL,16,F"can not proceed with trials and other
OL,17,Fhearings"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
