OL,4,ARussell Brand as 'frenzied' and
OL,5,A'violent'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,8,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,9,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies the
OL,10,Fcharges.
