OL,5,ACarney
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe province's premier says people
OL,8,F"voted for a stronger Alberta" -
OL,9,Fseparatist leader Jeffrey Rath tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC his "movement isn't stopping"
OL,12,FAs well as independence, voters were
OL,13,Fasked about a range of issues including
OL,14,Fimmigration and voter ID - here are the
