OL,3,ASuspect arrested after historic town
OL,4,Ahall set alight - French media
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 34-year-old suspect is known to
OL,7,Fpolice for acts of violence against
OL,8,Fpublic officials and is on the "S"
OL,9,Flist, a French national security
OL,10,Fwatchlist, FranceInfo and BFMTV
OL,11,Freported.
OL,13,FMeanwhile in Marseille, a curfew for
OL,14,Fyoung people will be introduced on
OL,15,FTuesday evening.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
